  "body": "## What changed\n- Added unit tests `cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field` and `cross_hole_off_lattice_floor_stamps_like_reloaded_and_dir_is_verbatim` in `crates/app/src/operation/hole_digest.rs`.\n- Pinned all ten `CrossHole` fields (`origin.x`, `origin.y`, `origin.z`, `dir.x`, `dir.y`, `dir.z`, `radius`, `entry_d`, `floor_d`, `through`) through both `hole_digest::cross` and `OpParams::Drill::stamp_with` with a `1e-6` mm lattice step.\n- Pinned sub-half-step (`2e-7` mm) invariance on snapped scalars and sub-lattice sensitivity on verbatim `dir`.\n- Corrected `1 um` and `half a micron` comments in `crates/app/src/operation/hole_digest.rs` to `1 nm (1e-6 mm)`.\n- Recorded the decision in `docs/decisions/1625-cross-hole-digest-pin.md` (branched from `upstream/main` `0db66c44`).\n\n## Cause\nPR #1623 extracted `operation/hole_digest.rs` with a unit pin only for axial `Hole`, leaving `CrossHole` unpinned. Its comments also described `cl::lattice` (`1e-6` mm) as a `1 um` lattice instead of a `1 nm` lattice.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins:\n  - `operation::hole_digest::tests::a_typed_floor_stamps_like_the_one_the_file_reloads` (pass)\n  - `operation::hole_digest::tests::cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field` (pass)\n  - `operation::hole_digest::tests::cross_hole_off_lattice_floor_stamps_like_reloaded_and_dir_is_verbatim` (pass)\n- Mutation results on `hole_digest::cross`:\n  - Drop `dir`: red (`cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field`, `cross_hole_off_lattice_floor_stamps_like_reloaded_and_dir_is_verbatim`), restored: green.\n  - Drop `radius`: red (`cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field`), restored: green.\n  - Drop `floor_d`: red (`cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field`, `cross_hole_off_lattice_floor_stamps_like_reloaded_and_dir_is_verbatim`), restored: green.\n  - Drop `origin.x`: red (`cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field`), restored: green.\n  - Drop `entry_d`: red (`cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field`), restored: green.\n  - Drop `through`: red (`cross_hole_stamp_moves_on_every_field`), restored: green.\n- Quick gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` green (`app lib`, `app:bore_core`, `app:bore_entry`; 66s, 0 failed).\n- Clippy: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Batch and release gate tiers.\n- Windows and macOS targets.\n- `RECOMMENDED.md` (cut-only; already absorbed `1560-hole-digest-lattice.md` at v0.20.0) and `crates/cl/src/cl/moves.rs` comments (outside scope).\n\n## Overlaps\nNone.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low (no escalation)\nFixes #1625\n",
